# A local checkout may already have submodules initialized and/or a
# build/install tree from a regular (non-Docker) build -- none of that
# may leak into the build context. Submodule content always comes from
# the submodules-* stages (fetched fresh from .git at the pinned
# commit, regardless of what's checked out locally), and build/install
# are produced fresh by this Dockerfile's own make steps. Mirrors what
# .gitignore already excludes from the real working tree.
contrib/
build
install/**
